1
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:43,000
Miss Tang, don't waste your energy.

2
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,259
His Highness won't open the door.

3
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,920
What exactly happened?

4
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,759
His Majesty has issued a decree

5
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:51,320
for the officials to discuss the crown prince nomination.

6
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:53,160
Although I don't understand politics,

7
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:55,320
having lived in the manor for a while

8
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,479
and learned a few things,

9
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:58,940
this should be a good thing for His Highness.

10
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,120
It is a good thing.

11
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,920
Jingxuan has been in politics for less than two years.

12
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,960
He is praised by the officials

13
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,480
and has gained a great reputation.

14
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,480
Then why?

15
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,479
The tallest tree in the forest

16
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:11,080
is the first to be blown down.

17
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:13,800
A few days ago, a rumor suddenly spread

18
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,720
that Jingxuan caused his biological mother's death

19
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:17,960
and is abandoned by heaven.

20
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,320
If he is made the crown prince,

21
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,450
it will bring disaster to the country.

22
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:24,140
The late Empress indeed died in childbirth.

23
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,040
His Highness never celebrates his birthday.

24
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:27,500
It's to mourn Her Majesty.

25
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,880
I wonder who would

26
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,920
poke His Highness's sore spot like this.

27
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:33,720
It's truly insane.

28
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,440
There are many causes for difficult labor,

29
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:39,040
especially for a firstborn.

30
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:41,260
How can the baby be entirely to blame?

31
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,560
That may be so,

32
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,900
but Jingxuan's inner demons are hard to dispel.

33
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,720
Mr. Su, could you do me a favor?

34
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,600
What do you mean, Miss Tang?

35
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,280
As a son,

36
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,100
he deserves to know the truth.

37
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,800
You're right.

38
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:04,040
Perhaps only the truth can give him peace.

39
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,490
That's how it happened.

40
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,840
Here are the medical records and prescriptions from back then.

41
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,970
I've circled the questionable parts.

42
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:41,720
The testimonies of the royal physicians, maids, and midwives from back then

43
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:44,200
who are still alive are all here.

44
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,680
Are you saying

45
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:53,090
someone replaced my mother's postpartum hemostatic medicine

46
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:55,810
with blood-activating medicine,

47
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,800
which killed her?

48
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,320
And the method was clever

49
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,780
and extremely covert.

50
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,840
Unless you are an experienced healer,

51
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,040
it's hard to detect.

52
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:18,220
If I don't avenge this,

53
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,880
I am not fit to be her son.

54
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:22,560
Jingxuan.

55
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,500
We have plenty of time.

56
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,320
You must not be hasty now.

57
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,320
I heard from Young Master Su

58
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,200
that His Majesty has dealt with

59
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,000
all those who spread the rumors.

60
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:49,820
What else is on Your Highness's mind?

61
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:53,480
Why didn't you dodge?

62
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,720
Your Highness wouldn't hurt me.

63
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:10,650
Your Highness's condition has improved.

64
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,720
Allow me to think for a few days

65
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,980
before prescribing the right medicine.

66
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,520
This is my specially made ointment.

67
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:20,440
It works wonders for relieving headaches.

68
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,680
I added osmanthus to it,

69
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,010
so it doesn't smell bad.

70
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:39,520
Is there any story behind your birthmark?

71
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,680
It's just a birthmark.

72
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:43,220
What story could there be?

73
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,640
Besides, since I fell off the cliff,

74
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,930
I've lost my memory.

75
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,370
Even if there is a story,

76
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:49,970
I wouldn't remember it.

77
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,960
Why are you so curious about my birthmark, Your Highness?

78
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,280
I once heard

79
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,820
that a person's birthmark

80
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,240
is a trace left from a past life.

81
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,840
It's a tear shed by a lover in a past life,

82
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,280
so they can find each other

83
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,080
and rekindle their romance.

84
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:09,200
You look so aloof, Your Highness.

85
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:11,530
How can you believe a storyteller's tale?

86
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:15,080
Don't you believe it, Miss Tang?

87
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:18,610
Confucius never talked about the supernatural.

88
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,280
Tang Zhiluo,

89
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,960
can I trust you?

90
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,480
Whether you trust me or not

91
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,880
is entirely up to you, Your Highness.

92
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,210
I don't need to say more.

93
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,680
What is this?

94
00:07:02,760 --> 00:07:04,020
It's called Soul Jade.

95
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,200
I don't know where it came from either.

96
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,920
I only know

97
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,340
that keeping it with me

98
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:12,800
prevents my headaches.

99
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:17,560
It seems to be a pair with your birthmark.

100
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:20,290
How can there be such a coincidence in this world?

101
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:25,200
Your Highness, may I borrow this jade pendant?

102
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,080
I don't mean anything else.

103
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:34,159
I just think this Soul Jade

104
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,380
might be able to cure your headaches.

105
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,040
Take it.

106
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:40,100
Thank you, Your Highness.

107
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,320
I will return it as soon as possible.

108
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,560
The shapes are so similar.

109
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:21,760
Pinellia, Gastrodia,

110
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,400
and...

111
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:52,640
I haven't seen you in such high spirits for a long time.

112
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,760
I came to tell you

113
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,460
that Miss Tang has met with Yuwen Jia.

114
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,160
Don't worry.

115
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,730
There seems to be a misunderstanding.

116
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,160
Miss Tang specifically asked to meet me

117
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,760
just to tell me about

118
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,420
my sixth brother's soul jade?

119
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,050
Exactly.

120
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:23,680
That piece of jade

121
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,010
indeed has a trick to it.

122
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,820
It can determine Lord Shuo's life and death.

123
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:34,600
I found out

124
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,880
that piece of jade

125
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:38,000
was soaked in Shanyue Lingzhi water,

126
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,560
which is why it has such a miraculous effect.

127
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,320
I remember

128
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,800
that Your Highness

129
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:44,480
happens to have one.

130
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:49,680
You want to ask for my Lingzhi, don't you?

131
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:06,000
It's not difficult to get this Lingzhi.

132
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,800
But miss,

133
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:09,170
you need to pay a corresponding price.

134
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,100
Your Highness, I have already...

135
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:31,960
Zhiluo,

136
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,800
why were you behind me?

137
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:40,280
That jade can cure Your Highness's headache.

138
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:44,720
I also got Lingzhi from Prince Yu.

139
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:45,840
Stop talking.

140
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,840
I'll go get the imperial physician.

141
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,400
It's okay. You'll be fine.

142
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:52,520
Imperial physician! Imperial physician!

143
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,480
It's too late.

144
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:55,200
It's too late.

145
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,080
It's too late, Your Highness.

146
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,280
I am a doctor myself.

147
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,040
It's a pity...

148
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,560
It's a pity that in the end, I still couldn't...

149
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,640
couldn't repay you.

150
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:10,280
Tang Zhiluo!

151
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,000
This is what I told you.

152
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,440
Dying for him in every life,

153
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:18,160
living for him in every life.

154
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:21,920
This is the price you pay as a goddess.
